node plane | Phase plane | uₙ,d × σ²
node polynomial | Polynomial | rare-cell bias | pays uₙ,d
node collision | Collision | uncrossed-cell bias | pays σ²+d/n²
node zero | Zero | zero branch
node homogeneity | Homogeneity | σ²=0 | d/n² scale
node unrestricted | Unrestricted | large alphabet | d²/{n² log²(en)}
node selector | Selector | chooses branch | no global commit
node benchmark | Benchmark | selector order
edge plane -> polynomial
edge plane -> collision
edge plane -> zero
edge homogeneity -> collision
edge unrestricted -> polynomial
edge polynomial -> selector
edge collision -> selector
edge zero -> selector
edge selector -> benchmark
